[en.IDEA_C09_TERM_EXCHANGE]
Term Exchange

[en.IDEA_C09_TERM_EXCHANGE_desc]
After Stella Flare and Firelight reconciled, the leadership of Sire’s Hollow alternates between the Development Committee and the Preservation Society regularly.

[zh.IDEA_C09_TERM_EXCHANGE]
交替任期

[zh.IDEA_C09_TERM_EXCHANGE_desc]
自从恒星耀斑和火光和解后，在名流谷联合会的框架下，由发展委员会和保护协会规律地交替领导着。
